13-Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: HorribleSubsScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:45.90,Title,,0,0,0,,LionDialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:08.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Brother Oven is furious!Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:10.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Get to the port!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run on the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Nor on the land!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:17.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Get off of the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:22.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So you chose to fight, Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:25.90,Main,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll execute you now!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:29.19,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad, Big Sis! We can't set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:31.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do with the cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.99,0:02:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Increase our speed!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:39.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Go straight to the port!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege's ship sped up!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:51.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he thinking?! He's gonna crash into the port!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he slowing down?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:00.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... it's a suicide attack?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.31,Main,,0,0,0,,It's sailing onto the coast!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:10.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back! Get ready to shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:15.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You traitor!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:19.09,Main,,0,0,0,,How about this, you little punks?Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:25.59,Main,,0,0,0,,This ship, the Nostra Castello...Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:28.89,Main,,0,0,0,,can sail on both water and land!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The paddles turned into tank caterpillars!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:55.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't think that was even possible!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:58.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That's because I never told you!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would I show all my tricks to the people I had already decided to betray?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:08.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You asshole!Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:11.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:15.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon! Hand the cake over to us!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That's impossible! The cake is gigantic!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,How are we going to hand such a big cake over to a ship moving that fast?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Whaaat?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.85,0:04:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The carriage is in the air?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:47.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What is going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:00.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Make room on the deck, Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:10.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Step back, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Make room on the deck!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! Father!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg! All right, come aboard!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:38.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He's using just one leg...Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:40.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he a cook?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:48.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Brace for impact!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake made it aboard!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:20.82,Main,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this wonderful fragrance?Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:25.41,Main,,0,0,0,,A-as expected of Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not a member of Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege! Pez!Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:32.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, honey?Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes...Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You've always been so reckless...Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama! Stay with us!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let them get away!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:04.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama! Please get out of the way!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:08.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who I am?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll stop them!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.74,Note,,0,0,0,,Squish!Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He got run over!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:23.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there there, Pez. It was a little loud back there, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,He's still there...Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:41.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy? Is he a pervert?Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:50.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the matter, Pez?Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:57.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It looks like she's happy.Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:05.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to sail towards the southeastern sea, Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:06.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay...Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.87,0:08:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We should just run through the town to get to the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:13.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll have to run over a few chocolate houses.Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:19.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:24.43,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the only way for us to depart safely!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:44.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What a waste.Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fix them later.Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Houses can be rebuilt. And so can families.Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It'd be better if they didn't break apart, but...Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,this is my home now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:02.00,Main,,0,0,0,,And you guys are my new family.Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:16.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop using the cannon!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You might blow up the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna get to the sea! Don't let them escape!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:27.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet! Head for the southeastern side of the island!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.74,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:42.96,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! We've made it off of Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:45.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hooray!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:57.27,Main,,0,0,0,,No one can catch up to this paddle ship now.Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:10:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Bege. You saved us.Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:04.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it for your sake, Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:09.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it oddly hot over here?Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.25,0:10:14.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, the sea looks weird-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:24.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Fish are floating to the surface!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:26.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea is so hot that it boiled them?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:29.73,Main,,0,0,0,,With the right amount of salt, they'd probably taste good...Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:32.15,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be next, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,There's only one person capable of this...Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Hot Sea Hell!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:45.82,Main,,0,0,0,,With my Heat-Heat Fruit ability...Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:49.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I will boil you all to death!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:56.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's simmering-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.61,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a bigger issue to worry about!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad! This'll affect the temperature of the chocolate!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The whipped cream will melt, too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That means...Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, Big Mom's cake will be ruined!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:16.51,Main,,0,0,0,,That idiot, what is he thinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom won't be satisfied with boiled fish!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.67,0:11:24.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The heat broke the paddles!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Rero-rero! Is he planning on sinking our ship?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:35.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Did Oven-sama forget how important this cake is?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:37.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay...Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay...Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sink...Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,sink!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You're acting strange... why have you been laughing so much, Pez?Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:11.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama! Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:15.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.21,0:12:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:46.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that-rero?Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he Oven-sama's arch-nemesis?Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:03.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Pound!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:09.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You're quite tough...Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:13.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:18.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill your stepson?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Father! The water's temperature is falling!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:30.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Fold up the paddles! Let's use this chance to push past the hot water!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:36.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, madam!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:45.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,To my grandson, who I don't even know the name of ...Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.56,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Are you happy?Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:53.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Make your mommy and daddy love you as much as possible...Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:58.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do that for my children...Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:02.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Not yet? Not yet?Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin, you gave birth!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:17.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Lola and Chiffon...Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:19.72,Main,,0,0,0,,They're twins.Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:23.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Twins?! I wanna hold them.Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:24.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You've already served your purpose.Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:34.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away.Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin?Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm their father! We're...Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You think they're your family? Don't overestimate yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:01.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are my children!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:03.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Please!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna hold them at least once!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:17.52,Main,,0,0,0,,They're... my children...Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:22.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That was 26 years ago...Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:27.79,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Chiffon... I'm glad I got to see you at least once.Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:32.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It seems like you're being chased,Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:36.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad that you look happy...Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Pez?Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:50.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine! We'll be out of this hot sea soon!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:54.10,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:03.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did I give birth to twins?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're probably a failure just like Lola!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.71,0:16:16.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:21.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Children who are useless to me aren't part of my family!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:30.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare show your face around me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:37.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's going to be all right. Your Papa and Mama are right here.Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:42.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I've been worried about you this whole time.Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:45.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Did you go through any hardships?Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:49.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Were you ever lonely?Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:55.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I couldn't be there for you on those days...Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:58.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I know I'm late...Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:02.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,but I wanted to tell you something.Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations...Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,on your marriage!Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:11.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon!!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:12.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We escaped-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep going at this speed and escape!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:29.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake barely survived.Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:34.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up! We don't have much time!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's begin the decorating!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.12,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,At Sea - The SunnyDialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:45.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I found you!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:49.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand over the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:58.01,Main,,0,0,0,,B-B... B-B-Big Mom?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:18:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at it, she's too strong for us!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:02.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'd be best to run...Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:11.14,Main,,0,0,0,,If we stop, that'll be the end! We need to get away somehow!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:15.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:17.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go first!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:19.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get them!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:22.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who's our enemy?Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.07,0:18:23.90,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hat crew!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:28.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right! But I don't see a straw hat anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Where is the Straw Hat crew?Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,They went that way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go! It's that way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the directions!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! We can't fly that far!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:45.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What were they?Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:54.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are all of the cannonballs so useless?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:56.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:19:00.07,Main,,0,0,0,,As you know, when Mama's out of control, they don't listen to us!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.07,0:19:02.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let me go next!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.19,0:19:03.78,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm next!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:09.43,Main,,0,0,1,,Bavarois-sama! I'll show you that I can do it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:10.79,Captions,,0,0,235,,26th Son of the Charlotte Family Charlotte BavaroisDialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:10.79,Note,,0,0,0,,Bavarois: Named after Bavarian Cream.Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.43,0:19:10.79,Main,,0,0,1,,Damn...Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama hasn't slowed down... and we're at full speed, too!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Why can't we catch up to them?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, they have Jinbe, who knows the seas like the back of his hand.Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:31.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Bavarois-sama! We just got a call!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:33.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Here they come!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:36.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:38.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Carrot?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:40.61,Main,,0,0,0,,There are a bunch of ships ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:44.73,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:47.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We've been pincered!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:57.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Third!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:23.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We just started up again. Don't be so erratic.Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:30.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you had escaped earlier, I am your opponent.Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody would've laughed at you if you did.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:37.11,Main,,0,0,0,,So why did you come back?Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:44.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you choose death over the shame of running away?Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,"Choose death"?Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Or did you notice the difference in our power...Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,and come back here to beg to become our subordinate?Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:56.69,Main,,0,0,0,,"Beg"?Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap...Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:06.38,Main,,0,0,0,,came here to beat you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:17.47,Main,,0,0,0,,"Came here to beat me"?Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.47,0:21:20.30,Main,,0,0,0,,That is not...Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:23.85,Main,,0,0,0,,an option!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:40.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn...Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:47.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Before we were able to get Big Mom and the others off of our tail, our path out of here was blocked!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.76,0:21:50.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Bavarois-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.73,0:21:55.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Daifuku-sama and his fleet have arrived just up ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:55.11,Captions,,0,0,290,,3rd Son of the Charlotte Family Charlotte DaifukuDialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,And we have reinforcements from behind!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:58.91,Main,,0,0,0,,From behind?Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.65,0:22:02.16,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.16,0:22:07.58,Main,,0,0,0,,A fleet of reinforcements led by Sweet Commander Smoothie-sama has arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:07.58,Captions,,0,0,230,,14th Daughter of the Charlotte Family Sweet Commander SmoothieDialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:12.22,Main,,0,0,0,,In addition,  Smoothie-sama's flag ship...Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:16.43,Captions,,0,700,235,,16th Daughter of the Charlotte Family CinnamonDialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:16.43,Captions,,650,0,235,,15th Daughter of the Charlotte Family CitronDialogue: 0,0:22:12.22,0:22:16.43,Main,,0,0,0,,has Citron-sama and Cinnamon-sama on board as well!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:18.23,Main,,0,0,0,,They're going that far?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,But with them, we'll be invincible!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's do it, men!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brother Peros, why is it taking so long for you to eliminate one little mouse?Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:38.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I just sink them?Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.07,0:22:41.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want. Lick...Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are so dramatic!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what happens... because Mama is heading to Cacao Island where Pudding is waiting.Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:54.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like Mama's getting thinner.Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick...Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:23:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:04.94,Main,,0,0,0,,All ships, prepare to fire!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as their ship comes within shooting range...Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.69,0:23:13.49,Main,,0,0,0,,let them have it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.27,0:23:15.57,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad...Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.57,0:23:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Daifuku's ships are preparing to fire their cannons!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.74,0:23:23.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're in their range yet...Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.18,0:23:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if we try to dodge, we're surrounded on all sides.Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:33.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, let's keep advancing without slowing down!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.84,0:23:40.18,Main,,0,0,0,,But we're up against Daifuku's ship... He controls a genie and is a formidable opponent!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.18,0:23:45.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to force our way through the front!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.39,0:23:48.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Right. Let's prepare ourselves.Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.65,0:23:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll start this off by taking a Rumble Ball! Get me close enough to jump onto their ship!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Fighting at close range... It's gonna be tough.Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.37,0:24:00.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.31,0:24:02.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.74,0:24:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll be in range soon.Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.88,0:24:10.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire all of our cannonballs at them.Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.19,0:24:14.01,Main,,0,0,0,,This is our chance!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.01,0:24:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, use the faceless cannonballs.Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.01,0:24:18.27,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.27,0:24:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Daifuku-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.55,0:24:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.88,0:24:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.02,0:24:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:28.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me handle Daifuku and the others!Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.76,0:24:32.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely be useful!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.64,0:24:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.31,0:24:38.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Because...Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,tonight's a full moon...Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.52,0:24:48.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... Sulong?! Are you trained for it?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.52,0:24:48.07,Note,,0,0,0,,Sulong: "Moon Lion"Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.07,0:24:52.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry... Pedro trained me.Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.12,0:24:56.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I know what Pedro would say right now...Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.66,0:25:00.25,Main,,0,0,0,,"Leave it to me."Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.25,0:25:02.80,Main,,0,0,0,,If Carrot is going, I'm going with her!Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:06.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm still a Musketeer, after all!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.24,0:25:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, man the cannons!Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:15.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll shoot salvos and sink it quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.69,0:25:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for my cue!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.64,0:25:22.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Pedro?Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.73,0:25:27.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,One day, you'll see how important it was...Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.03,0:25:31.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,to allow Luffy and the others to set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.33,0:25:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fight...Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.67,0:25:38.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,for your-teia share as well...Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.35,0:25:42.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.47,0:26:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.17,0:27:08.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Her eyes are red... She looks like a different person...Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot... She's so beautiful...Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.31,0:27:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,How mystical...Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.27,0:27:18.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, she looks pretty amazing...Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.45,0:27:21.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see her panties...Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.39,0:27:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that what Duke Inuarashi was talking about?Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.49,0:27:28.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But after that battle...Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:35.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,this was the result we had against Jack's squad, a subset of Kaidou's army.Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.54,0:27:41.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But we won't let that happen again! We will not repeat the same mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.42,0:27:43.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We have our trump card.Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.47,0:27:49.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If we fight them again, we'll show them the true power of the Mink Tribe!Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.51,0:27:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,This must be the trump card he was talking about...Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.26,0:27:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The true power of...Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.48,0:27:58.39,Main,,0,0,0,,the Mink Tribe!Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.90,0:28:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me that's...Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.16,0:28:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad, Daifuku-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.50,0:28:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Tonight's a full moon! That Mink girl that's with the enemy...Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.75,0:28:25.25,Main,,0,0,0,,turned Sulong!Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.58,0:28:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys! Prepare for a close-quarters battle!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.21,0:28:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'm correct, Pedro was from Zou, the Phantom Island...Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.82,0:28:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess she's from the same place...Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:50.81,Main,,0,0,0,,She's gonna fall into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.56,0:28:54.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What the...Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.15,0:28:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,She just flew up from the surface!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.20,0:29:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing...Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.04,0:29:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not all...Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.37,0:29:08.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Here she comes! Shoot her down!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.29,0:29:10.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't lower your guard! Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.89,0:29:13.23,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a warrior from Zou! They're on a different level!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:17.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll bring her down!Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.34,0:29:21.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.39,0:29:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back! Take her out!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.16,0:29:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.41,0:29:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got you!Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.32,0:30:19.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.79,0:30:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn little rat!Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.42,0:30:30.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you plan on fighting all of the soldiers in this fleet in order to stop us?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.09,0:30:35.51,Main,,0,0,0,,While you're doing that, your ship will sink! Stop your futile resistance and...Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.55,0:30:39.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The helm?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.47,0:30:43.23,Main,,0,0,0,,S-She broke the helm!Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.23,0:30:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Where is our ship heading?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.06,0:30:50.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That little rat!Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.24,0:30:56.90,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.52,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YDialogue: 0,0:00:05.